    "id": "705235450 DF014",
    "title": "Acquisition, Capability and Management Service (ACAMS)",
    "description": "2 Stage further competition via DOS5 CCS Framework. \r\n\r\nContract is a £1 contract, placed with a not to exceed figure, placing individual Statements of Work on the contract for the following scope: A Delivery Partner is required to ensure the continuity of this service to support critical business applications and Defences' wider automation agenda under the digital backbone.\r\n\r\nAligning to GDS and MOD Frameworks and Policies, the successful Supplier (heron referred to as 'Delivery Partner') will help grow and support the in-house capability for delivering Automated solutions to Defence, within a multi-disciplinary multi-supplier team, with a key focus on, but not limited to, the Microsoft Power Platform, where the Delivery Partner will utilise links from existing and new data sources.",
